        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">The Canterbury Tales</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1387 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/geoffrey-chaucer">Geoffrey Chaucer</a>, who wrote it between 1387 and 1400 while serving as Controller of Customs, Justice of the Peace and Clerk of the King's Works; copied by scribes, among them one identified as Adam Pinkhurst</span></div>
